What changed
Removed every inline handler: no onclick, oninput, onchange, or similar attributes remain in the markup.
Removed all HTML injection: no innerHTML, outerHTML, insertAdjacentHTML, or document.write is used anywhere.
Replaced with safe DOM construction: every element is created via document.createElement, text is set via textContent, values are set via properties like .value, and attributes use setAttribute.
Event listeners centralized: controls are wired in a single wireEvents() function using addEventListener.
No alert/confirm: user feedback uses the in-app toast.

Functionality is otherwise identical: editable roles, message beats, shot notes, coherence checks, copy/downloadable image brief, and save/load to JSON — all offline in one file.

